From aebd9aa53dff290dacfb79590ec01b98ea1dac70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:36:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vold: restore the session keyring fallback for kernels
 without FS_IOC_ADD_ENCRYPTION_KEY

Reverts 0e87a83 (same as LineageOS 23.x 5cbee14). Still needed for 4.9 devices.
libkeyutils was removed from system/core in Android 17, so carry it here.

Change-Id: I75fc9859dacf005205d572f149af934263995ebb
